#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spreadsheet_help_oca.field_spreadsheet_tutorial__tour_name
msgid ""
"Technical name of a tour registered under Settings > Technical > Tours (e.g."
" spreadsheet_quick_start). If set, the 'Interactive Tour' button launches "
